Narrator: Sutherland leans in to the radio and to solve the frequency puzzle. As he solved it, a voice is heard.
Smith: Suth? Can you hear me? How are you doing...
Sutherland: (speaking to himself, not the radio) I can't do this today...
Smith: Well, look Suth, we've got some increased traffic expected this week. I know you... you've got a lot going on. But do you think you could turn your light on? I know you've got some mechanical issues since the attack... Radio me if you can. Or if you just want to talk. I'm here.